@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### Create CUSTOMER metadata document
POST {{baseUrl}}/runtime/CUSTOMER
x-tenant-id: 1
x-domain-code: 1.26.1.0
x-application-code: CRM
x-user-id: admin
x-permissions: CUSTOMER.CREATE,CUSTOMER.READ,CUSTOMER.UPDATE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "customerName": "ABC Company",
    "email": "test@mail.com",
    "phone": "+62000000000"
  }
}

### Read CUSTOMER documents from CRM metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/runtime/CUSTOMER
x-tenant-id: 1
x-domain-code: 1.26.1.0
x-application-code: CRM
x-user-id: admin
x-permissions: CUSTOMER.READ
